{"material_id": "ntce.youer.baojiao.2012b.q14.material.recovered", "text": "儿童的一百种语言不，一百种是在那里孩子是由一百种组成的孩子有一百种语言一百双手一百个念头还有一百种思考、游戏、说话的方式有一百种快乐，去歌唱去理解一百种歌唱与了解的喜悦一百种世界去探索去发现一百种世界去发明一百种世界去梦想", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "2e625a0150cb8ab65b81ad33508ffee2f36c475ae4caa624466932b27d9831c6", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 913, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1024, "next_source_question_number": 14, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 14, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "2e625a0150cb8ab65b81ad33508ffee2f36c475ae4caa624466932b27d9831c6"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2012b.q14"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.m5.k01", "ntce.youer.baojiao.m6.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.design", "ntce.youer.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": [], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2012b.q14"], "word_count": 111, "level": "youer", "subject": "baojiao", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "2e625a0150cb8ab65b81ad33508ffee2f36c475ae4caa624466932b27d9831c6", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 913, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1024, "next_source_question_number": 14, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 14, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "2e625a0150cb8ab65b81ad33508ffee2f36c475ae4caa624466932b27d9831c6"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_statu