{"material_id": "ntce.youer.baojiao.2012b.q15.material.recovered", "text": "李老师发现大班“理发店”的顾客很少。“顾客”对理发店不感兴趣。于是李老师带幼儿到理发店参观，看理发店的设施，鼓励幼儿向理发师咨询问题，记录幼儿的问题，还拍下照片，幼儿在理发店看到顾客躺着洗头，梳理发型。回到幼儿园，李老师组织幼儿讨论“如何开好理发店”，并把照片给孩子回顾，有的幼儿反映没有躺椅，有的反映没有发型梳，李老师则启发幼儿自己用积木做躺椅。自己画发型，之后。“理发店”生意红火了起来。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "2e625a0150cb8ab65b81ad33508ffee2f36c475ae4caa624466932b27d9831c6", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1073, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1269, "next_source_question_number": 15, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 15, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "2e625a0150cb8ab65b81ad33508ffee2f36c475ae4caa624466932b27d9831c6"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2012b.q15"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.m5.k01", "ntce.youer.baojiao.m5.k02", "ntce.youer.baojiao.m6.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.design", "ntce.youer.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.102.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2012b.q15"], "word_count": 196, "level": "youer", "subject": "baojiao", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "2e625a0150cb8ab65b81ad33508ffee2f36c475ae4caa624466932b27d9831c6", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1073, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1269, "next_source_question_number": 15, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 15, "alignment_status": "